---

Analyze the resume against the job description and skills. Return ONLY a JSON object with this exact structure:

{
  "matchScore": <number 0-100>,
  "summary": "<2-3 sentence assessment>",
  "skillMatches": [
    {"skill": "<skill name>", "matched": <true/false>, "evidence": "<brief evidence from resume>"}
  ],
  "strengths": ["<strength 1>", "<strength 2>", ...],
  "gaps": ["<gap 1>", "<gap 2>", ...],
  "recommendation": "<STRONG_MATCH|GOOD_MATCH|PARTIAL_MATCH|WEAK_MATCH>"
}

Scoring guidelines:
- 80-100: STRONG_MATCH — meets all must-have skills, most preferred
- 60-79: GOOD_MATCH — meets most must-have skills
- 40-59: PARTIAL_MATCH — meets some requirements
- 0-39: WEAK_MATCH — significant gaps
